{"sha": "94a17d8e371a310e507df3f5b6f71ff712ea43caaa4ecc5ff36c6cc07f7cd92e", "body": ["\\section*{第 \\ref{ch:g10:algebra} 章 --- 代数：方程与不等式}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:1}", "$3(2x-5) - 2(x-7) = 6x - 15 - 2x + 14 = 4x - 1$.", "", "$(x+4)(2x-1) = 2x^2 - x + 8x - 4 = 2x^2 + 7x - 4$.", "", "$(3x-2)^2 = 9x^2 - 12x + 4$.", "", "$(5-x)(5+x) = 25 - x^2$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:2}", "$x^2 - 49 = (x+7)(x-7)$（平方差）。", "", "$x^2 + 10x + 25 = (x+5)^2$.", "", "$7x^2 - 14x = 7x(x - 2)$（提取公因式）。", "", "$16x^2 - 8x + 1 = (4x - 1)^2$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:3}", "$4x + 9 = x - 3$：$3x = -12$，故 $x = -4$。", "", "$\\frac{2x-1}{3} = 5$：$2x - 1 = 15$，故 $x = 8$。", "", "$2(x-3) = 2x + 1$ 展开得 $2x - 6 = 2x + 1$，即 $-6 = 1$，", "对任意 $x$ 都不成立。无解——两边分别表示的两条直线", "平行，永不相交。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:4}", "$(x+5)(2x-8) = 0$：$x = -5$ 或 $x = 4$。", "", "$x^2 - 16 = (x-4)(x+4) = 0$：$x = 4$ 或 $x = -4$。", "", "$x^2 + 6x + 9 = (x+3)^2 = 0$：唯一解为 $x = -3$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:5}", "$3x - 5 \\leq 7$：$3x \\leq 12$，故 $x \\leq 4$，解集为", "$\\intoc{-\\infty}{4}$。", "", "$-4x + 1 > 9$：$-4x > 8$，两边除以 $-4$，不等号方向改变：", "$x < -2$，解集为 $\\intoo{-\\infty}{-2}$。", "", "$2(x-1) \\geq 5x + 4$：$2x - 2 \\geq 5x + 4$，故 $-3x \\geq 6$，于是", "$x \\leq -2$，解集为 $\\intoc{-\\infty}{-2}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:6}", "公因式为 $(x-1)$：", "\\[", "E = (x-1)\\bigl[(x+3) - (2x - 5)\\bigr] = (x-1)(x + 3 - 2x + 5)", "= (x-1)(8 - x).", "\\]", "于是，$E = 0$ 当 $x = 1$ 或 $x = 8$ 时成立（零乘积法则）。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:7}", "$x^2 = 5x$：$x^2 - 5x = x(x - 5) = 0$，故 $x = 0$ 或 $x = 5$（切勿", "两边同除以 $x$，否则会丢失解 $0$）。", "", "$(2x+1)^2 = (x-4)^2$：移项，并利用平方差", "公式分解：", "\\[", "(2x+1)^2 - (x-4)^2", "= \\bigl[(2x+1) + (x-4)\\bigr]\\bigl[(2x+1) - (x-4)\\bigr]", "= (3x - 3)(x + 5).", "\\]", "由零乘积法则得 $x = 1$ 或 $x = -5$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:8}", "$(x+2)(4-x) > 0$：因式 $x + 2$ 在 $-2$ 处为零（其后为正），", "$4 - x$ 在 $4$ 处为零（其前为正）。乘积为正", "当且仅当两个因式同时为正，即在 $\\intoo{-2}{4}$ 上。", "", "$\\frac{2x-6}{x+1} \\geq 0$：分子在 $3$ 处为零，分母在", "$-1$ 处为零（不允许取值）。符号表：商为正当且仅当两部分", "同号，即 $x < -1$ 或 $x > 3$；商在 $x = 3$ 处为零。", "解集为 $\\intoo{-\\infty}{-1} \\cup \\intco{3}{+\\infty}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:9}", "经过 $x$ 个月后，第一种服务的费用为 $9x + 15$，第二种为 $12x$。", "第一种更便宜的条件是", "\\[", "9x + 15 < 12x", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "15 < 3x", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "x > 5 .", "\\]", "从第 $6$ 个月起，第一种服务总体上是更划算的选择。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:10}", "不允许的值：$x = 1$。当 $x \\neq 1$ 时，两边同乘 $x - 1$：", "\\[", "x + 3 = 2(x - 1) = 2x - 2", "\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\", "x = 5 .", "\\]", "由于 $5 \\neq 1$，故解为 $x = 5$。验算：", "$\\frac{5+3}{5-1} = \\frac84 = 2$.", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:g10:algebra:11}", "$(n+1)^2 - n^2 = n^2 + 2n + 1 - n^2 = 2n + 1$，它对", "每个整数 $n$ 都是奇数。", ""]}